# Inventory Management System

## Features

- Flask REST API
- CRUD Operations
- CLI Interface
- OpenFoodFacts API Integration
- Unit Testing

## Installation

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd inventory-management
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Start Flask Server

```bash
python app.py
```

## Run CLI

```bash
python cli.py
```

## Run Tests

```bash
pytest
```